     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">A simpler way to do it is to put population.pdf into a www/ subdirectory, and then make a link to it in the UI, with:<div>  a(&quot;download file&quot;, href = &quot;population.pdf&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>This assumes that the file is static and won&#39;t change in response to user input.</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
